ike lightning embosomed among clouds.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.825,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-52-19"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3050022","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"a12e2587c6e1a912ecdfeb9980ddf364af27685fd9dcc0c736175b93cd7080a5","compact":"6f1b85e68ca2a6e2bdd22b4bcc15bb7873b913664182938fa99722b0e367f98c","nasal":"6f1b85e68ca2a6e2bdd22b4bcc15bb7873b913664182938fa99722b0e367f98c"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-50-23","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":50,"verse":23,"english":"And in consequence of Vaidehi's ornaments sending sounds, the lord of Rākşasas resembled an entirely dark rumbling cloud.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.78,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-52-20"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3050023","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"ea0f6c6a66c2475ad01ffa5c137c06b883817178274dd31173b3efd498561597","compact":"b574a53ef648a535f367e3873837ce4db61eadfbc216ecbf75c020e874aa50ae","nasal":"b574a53ef648a535f367e3873837ce4db61eadfbc216ecbf75c020e874aa50ae"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-50-24","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":50,"verse":24,"english":"As Sītā was being borne away, showers of blossoms, falling off from her head, were scattered all around on the earth beneath.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-52-21"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3050024","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"d193fabb828e0860bdef14e3fefbd5b030b2d8bce3eed6a931123c43d4c419cd","compact":"9d30951aba66fcf09ecf54f80bdcbef6b21772d8efc3fddf411d84d04144ebe9","nasal":"4b032a67368695f315c2f95177531f9d0252709f0fce7f0a0951fe331ad83120"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-50-25","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":50,"verse":25,"english":"And 